--
-- whynot reads it: a relation that neither a rule nor a fact of the world
-- concludes is named with the file that would, and is not loaded, or said to
-- be concluded by no file of the model, which is a real gap
-- (w_whynot_tells_absent_from_unloaded). Any world may carry such an index
-- of its own units.

